{
  "envelope": "jiuan.agent/v1",
  "description": "Nexus（v0.3.28）返回的错误 → 九安模型错误码 → 审批流怎么处理。autoRetry 指AI 步骤的「自动重试一次」：每轮审批最多一次，隔 5 秒；false 的直接停在「AI 初审失败」，由人重试或转人工。依据：Nexus nexus_utils/publication_gateway/executor.py:75-117、auth.py:90-103、gates.py。",
  "entries": [
    {
      "match": {
        "http": 401,
        "rpcCode": -32010,
        "nexusCodes": [
          "api_key_required",
          "ambiguous_api_key",
          "credential_invalid",
          "credential_revoked",
          "credential_expired",
          "credential_owner_inactive",
          "credential_kind_not_allowed"
        ]
      },
      "jiuanCode": "AI_AUTH_INVALID",
      "autoRetry": false,
      "action": "这把调用密钥不能用：标记失效；有别的可用密钥就换，没有就停在「AI 初审失败」，提示管理员换密钥"
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "http": 404,
        "rpcCode": -32011,
        "nexusCodes": [
          "publication_not_found"
        ]
      },
      "jiuanCode": "AI_UNAVAILABLE",
      "autoRetry": false,
      "action": "发布暂停、A2A 通道关了、发布者预算用完被自动暂停、Agent 不可用，或者这把密钥属于别的发布：先核对路由表里的发布编号和密钥，再通知 Agent 负责人；转人工"
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "http": 429,
        "rpcCode": -32012,
        "nexusCodes": [
          "budget_exceeded"
        ]
      },
      "jiuanCode": "AI_UNAVAILABLE",
      "autoRetry": false,
      "action": "发布者预算用完，发布已被自动暂停：转人工，通知 Agent 负责人"
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "http": 429,
        "rpcCode": -32012,
        "nexusCodes": [
          "rate_limited",
          "too_many_inflight"
        ]
      },
      "jiuanCode": "AI_RATE_LIMIT",
      "autoRetry": true,
      "action": "按 Retry-After 等待后自动重试一次"
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "http": 413,
        "rpcCode": -32600,
        "nexusCodes": [
          "payload_too_large",
          "invalid_request"
        ]
      },
      "jiuanCode": "AI_REQUEST_INVALID",
      "autoRetry": false,
      "action": "请求太大或格式不对：九安的组装有问题，转人工并记录"
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "rpcCode": -32005,
        "nexusCodes": [
          "attachment_type_not_supported",
          "attachment_url_not_supported"
        ]
      },
      "jiuanCode": "AI_REQUEST_INVALID",
      "autoRetry": false,
      "action": "v1 不发文件 Part；出现说明组装有问题"
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "rpcCode": -32602,
        "nexusCodes": [
          "too_many_attachments",
          "attachment_too_large",
          "attachments_too_large",
          "invalid_attachment"
        ]
      },
      "jiuanCode": "AI_REQUEST_INVALID",
      "autoRetry": false,
      "action": "同上"
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "http": 503,
        "rpcCode": -32013,
        "nexusCodes": [
          "gateway_unavailable"
        ]
      },
      "jiuanCode": "AI_UNAVAILABLE",
      "autoRetry": true,
      "action": "Nexus 暂时不可用：自动重试一次"
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "taskState": "rejected",
        "nexusCodes": [
          "message_too_long",
          "invalid_message",
          "invalid_conversation_id"
        ]
      },
      "jiuanCode": "AI_REQUEST_INVALID",
      "autoRetry": false,
      "action": "超过 10 万字或会话编号不合规：九安的组装有问题，转人工并记录"
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "taskState": "rejected",
        "nexusCodes": [
          "conversation_busy"
        ]
      },
      "jiuanCode": "AI_RATE_LIMIT",
      "autoRetry": true,
      "action": "同一会话上一轮还没结束：自动重试一次（每轮重试用新的会话编号）"
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "taskState": "rejected",
        "nexusCodes": [
          "agent_unavailable",
          "session_unavailable",
          "public_origin_unavailable"
        ]
      },
      "jiuanCode": "AI_UNAVAILABLE",
      "autoRetry": true,
      "action": "自动重试一次"
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "taskState": "failed",
        "nexusCodes": [
          "timeout",
          "agent_error",
          "model_rate_limited",
          "stream_failed",
          "interrupted",
          "internal_error",
          "attachment_store_failed"
        ]
      },
      "jiuanCode": "AI_UNAVAILABLE",
      "autoRetry": true,
      "action": "Agent 这一轮没有完成：自动重试一次"
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "taskState": "canceled",
        "nexusCodes": [
          "cancelled"
        ]
      },
      "jiuanCode": "AI_CANCELLED",
      "autoRetry": false,
      "action": "九安取消（超时或单据变了）：按九安的取消原因处理"
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "client": "stream_dropped_then_task_not_found"
      },
      "jiuanCode": "AI_UNAVAILABLE",
      "autoRetry": true,
      "action": "流断了，tasks/get 也查不到（Nexus 网关重启过）：自动重试一次；注意这会再计费一次"
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "client": "network_error"
      },
      "jiuanCode": "AI_NETWORK",
      "autoRetry": true,
      "action": "连不上 Nexus：自动重试一次"
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "client": "invalid_result_after_repair"
      },
      "jiuanCode": "AI_INVALID_RESPONSE",
      "autoRetry": true,
      "action": "返回不符合契约，在同一会话里要求修正一次后仍不符合：自动重试一次（新会话）"
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "client": "aborted"
      },
      "jiuanCode": "AI_CANCELLED",
      "autoRetry": false,
      "action": "九安的超时或取消：先发 tasks/cancel，再抛出"
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "result": "declined"
      },
      "jiuanCode": "AI_DECLINED",
      "autoRetry": false,
      "action": "Agent 认为这个请求不归它做或做不了：不重试，转人工；理由记进留痕（多半是路由表配错了，或输入缺了关键内容）"
    }
  ]
}
